  "exp.mcp.step1Html": "Create a token at <a href=\"{page}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">kaggle.com/settings</a> → <em>Account</em> tab → <em>API</em> section → <em>Generate New Token</em> (it starts with <code>KGAT_</code>).",
